 "notes": "Stapelbäddsparken (skatepark, way/96744343) is in the idrott list; Ribersborgsstranden, Sibbarp's beach and Scaniabadet are in 'bad'. Sibbarp overlaps with bad; pick one category. Limhamns kalkbrott and Öresundsparken are in the game already but absent from the park long list; Lindängelund is the city's biggest park project but has no OSM polygon, so it would need an outline built from Millennieskogen (way/55801342) + Engelska parken (way/30037703) or left out. Jesusparken = Falsterboplan; I kept the northern half under the popular name and dropped the southern half. Alnarpsparken (Lomma) is well visited by Malmö people but kept in everything, outsideMalmo. Saltholm (Danish island) is in everything only as a visible landmark; drop it if Denmark should stay out. Borderline core candidates left in everything: Garnisonsplanteringen ('Tjyvaparken'), Gyllins trädgård, Käglinge naturområde, Ögårdsparken, Magistratsparken, Raoul Wallenbergs park, Bunkeflo strandängar."
}